{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04966","headline":"哭富嘉谟 · 吴少微","name":"哭富嘉谟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾友适不死，於戏社稷臣。\n直禄非造利，长怀大庇人。\n乃通承明籍，遘此敦牂春。\n药厉其可畏，皇穹故匪仁。\n畴昔与夫子，孰云异天伦。\n同病一相失，茫茫不重陈。\n子之文章在，其殆尼父新。\n鼓兴斡河岳，贞词毒鬼神。\n可悲不可朽，车輤没荒榛。\n圣主贤爲宝，吁兹大国贫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴少微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}